---
wide: true
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
title: "Mushroom research"
description: "Entries on peer-reviewed studies of medicinal and culinary mushrooms: cognition, immunity, oncology, physical performance, antioxidants."
permalink: "/en/issledovaniya/"
---

<header class="page-header">
  <p class="page-header__eyebrow">Scientific sources</p>
  <h1 class="page-header__title">Mushroom research</h1>
  <p class="page-header__lead">
    A catalog of peer-reviewed papers and reviews on medicinal and
    culinary mushrooms. Every entry links directly to the original
    publication — usually PubMed, Cochrane, Frontiers or the National
    Cancer Institute. The site text is our retelling of the finding; for
    details, figures and limitations, go to the primary source.
  </p>
</header>

<section aria-label="Filter by category">
  <div class="filters research-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter by research category">
    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-research-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">
      All <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="all"></span>
    </button>
    {% for cat in categories.research %}
      <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-research-filter="{{ cat.id }}" aria-pressed="false" style="--filter-accent: {{ cat.color }};">
        {{ cat.title_en or cat.title }} <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="{{ cat.id }}"></span>
      </button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="research-catalog" class="card-grid" aria-live="polite">
  {% for item in collections.issledovaniyaEn %}
    <article class="card card--research" data-category="{{ item.data.category }}" style="--cat-color: {% for c in categories.research %}{% if c.id == item.data.category %}{{ c.color }}{% endif %}{% endfor %};">
      <div class="card--research__cat" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="card--research__cat-dot"></span>
        <span class="card--research__cat-label">{{ item.data.category_label }}</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="card__title">
        <a href="{{ item.url | url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a>
      </h3>

      <p class="card__summary">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>

      <dl class="card--research__meta">
        {% if item.data.mushroom %}
          <dt>Mushroom</dt><dd>{{ item.data.mushroom }}</dd>
        {% endif %}
        {% if item.data.design %}
          <dt>Design</dt><dd>{{ item.data.design }}</dd>
        {% endif %}
        <dt>Source</dt>
        <dd><a href="{{ item.data.source_url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{{ item.data.source_name }}</a>, {{ item.data.year }}</dd>
      </dl>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<script src="{{ '/assets/js/research-filter.js' | url }}?v={{ site.version }}" defer></script>
